      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPEAK TO ME (5) boxed on well to finish third last time, beaten 2 lengths (18.86) behind Winsome Willy at this track. Expected to feature in the finish again. ROCKET TERRY (1) has the advantage of a nice draw for her first outing. Can kick off with a good run. NO EYE CONTACT (2) had the drop on the lead and went on to be beaten 2 lengths into second (18.81) at this track in a Maiden over 320m. Expected to be in the finish again. RAPIDA COCO (4) is a newcomer from the George Tyrpenou kennel. No favours with the draw and will need to begin well. Profiles well so watch market closely.",
